WEBVTT

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.041
Ako ste akutno pod stresom,
to nije veliki problem,

00:13:00.041 --> 00:13:01.670
ali trajan stres

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.961
vezan za gubitak sna
jeste problem.

00:13:03.961 --> 00:13:08.370
Dakle, trajan stres
dovodi do slabljenja imuniteta,

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:11.927
pa su umorni ljudi skloni
češćim infekcijama,

00:13:11.927 --> 00:13:13.629
postoje studije
koje vrlo dobro pokazuju

00:13:13.629 --> 00:13:17.365
da radnici u smenama npr.
imaju višu stopu obolevanja od raka.

00:13:17.365 --> 00:13:20.643
Povećani nivoi stresa
šalju glukozu u krvotok.

00:13:20.643 --> 00:13:24.734
Glukoza postaje
dominantan deo krvnih sudova

00:13:24.734 --> 00:13:27.313
i vi postajete netolerantni na glukozu.

00:13:27.313 --> 00:13:29.484
Dakle, dijabetes tipa 2.

00:13:29.484 --> 00:13:33.008
Stres povećava
kardiovaskularne bolesti,